Third-party models
------------------
The Git repository and the Python package do not contain model weights. When the optional
NER feature is used, the following models are downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub at
pinned revisions. The Cloakix Docker image includes them. Their full license texts are in
the licenses/ folder.

* CAMeL-Lab/bert-base-arabic-camelbert-mix-ner
  CAMeL Lab, New York University Abu Dhabi. Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/CAMeL-Lab/bert-base-arabic-camelbert-mix-ner
  See licenses/camelbert-mix-ner.Apache-2.0.txt

* dslim/bert-base-NER
  Hugging Face user "dslim". MIT License.
  Fine-tuned from google-bert/bert-base-cased (Google, Apache License 2.0).
  https://huggingface.co/dslim/bert-base-NER
  See licenses/bert-base-NER.MIT.txt

Their licenses apply to those models.
